    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the end of three years from the date of this permission.\r\n\r\nReason: In order to comply with the provisions of Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).\r\n\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans:\r\n\r\n2413-EMR-ZZ-RL-AP-A-01101 PL01, 2413-EMR-ZZ-01-AP-A-00103 PL01, 2413-EMR-ZZ-02-AP-A-00104 PL01, 2413-EMR-ZZ-03-AP-A-00105 PL01, 2413-EMR-ZZ-04-AP-A-00106 PL01, 2413-EMR-ZZ-05-AP-A-00107 PL01, 2413-EMR-ZZ-06-AP-A-00108 PL01, 2413-EMR-ZZ-07-AP-A-00109 PL01, 2413-EMR-ZZ-ZZ-AP-A-00117 PL01, 2413-EMR-ZZ-ZZ-AP-A-31102 PL02, 2413-EMR-ZZ-ZZ-AP-A-31302 PL01, 2413-EMR-ZZ-ZZ-AP-A-31303 PL01, 2413-EMR-ZZ-ZZ-DR-A-05101 PL01, Cover Letter & Planning Statement (prepared by Rolfe Judd, dated 26 August 2025), Design & Access Statement (prepared by Emrys Architects, dated August 2025), Heritage Statement (prepared by Smith Jenkins, dated August 2025), Proposed Window Design Note - DN02 (Milieu)\r\n\r\nReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interest of proper planning.\r\n",
